Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们猜怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴瑞和敏蒂要离婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Barry and Mindy are getting a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   你是怎么搞的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是巴瑞和敏蒂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Barry and Mindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我一听到离婚就觉得是罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sorry. I hear "divorce," I immediately go to Ross. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是巴瑞和敏蒂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's Barry and Mindy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴瑞是我差点要嫁的人   敏蒂是我最要好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Barry was the guy I almost married, and Mindy was my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是有一腿嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wasn't he cheating on you with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   但那只表示他做到一半   会在她身上睡着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but that just means he was falling asleep on top of her instead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我真的嫁给他   我的人生会多么不同\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could you imagine if I actually married him?! I mean how different would my life be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂你的意思   我也总是在想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know what you mean, I've always wondered how different my life would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我没有离婚会怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if I'd never gotten divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪一次   第一次啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which time? The first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  要是卡萝没发现  她是同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No seriously, imagine if Carol hadn't realized she was a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法想像  我老是朝好的方面去想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't. I keep seeing it the good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我一定还在练控手道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd bet I'd still be doing my kara-tay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来在我婚姻末期   我经常练控手道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Towards the end of our marriage, I was doing a lot of kara-tay as a way of releasing the tension...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.09,0:01:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好发泄一下因缺乏肉体运动而多余的精力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...from, you know, not doing anything else physical.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你不把空手道  念成控手道就没事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe the problem was pronouncing it "ka-ra-tay."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我还是很胖呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what if I was still fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定不会跟我交往  当然会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, You wouldn't be dating me, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊  你们真的觉得我那么肤浅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You guys really think that I'm that shallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只是觉得摩妮卡太胖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I think Monica was that fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我没被 《我们的日子》开除呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, imagine if I'd never gotten fired off Days of Our Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝又出现了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, there's Carol again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我有勇气辞职呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if I had had the guts to quit my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能在帮《纽约客》写稿   拿搞笑来赚钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd probably be writing for The New Yorker, being paid to be funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.17,0:01:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的工作也很有趣   而且明天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But my job's fun too. I mean, tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上班也不必打领带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I don't have to wear a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我去美林证券上班呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if I'd taken that job at Merrill Lynch?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   美林证券\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Merrill Lynch?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   我有个客人在那上班   他说我天生具有炒股的头脑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I had a massage client who worked there and-and he said I had a knack for stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么不去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well why didn't you take the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为当时我很相信押韵这回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because at that time, you see, I thought that everything that rhymed was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.98,0:02:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得要是我去做股票  就得住地窖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I thought y'know that if I'd work with stocks,...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能吃安眠药  养三脚猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'd have to live in a box and only eat lox and have a pet fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得如果有这些事   我们还会在一起吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, do you guys think that if all those things happened, we'd still hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第15集  假想篇外篇（上集）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E15  The One That Could Have Been
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   瑞秋葛林\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Rachel Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,劳勃提尔曼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah! Rob Tilman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.21,0:03:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对  是我  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, heh, no, it's me. Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.59,0:03:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起   罗斯提尔曼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry. Ross Tilman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是  是罗斯盖勒  也对  摩妮卡的哥哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, no. Ross Geller. Of course! Monica's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Right. Wow! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好   很好   我结婚了  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Good, I'm married. Oh! Me too! Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚真好  不是吗   就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't it the best? Oh, it's the best. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡好吗   好  真的非常好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, um, how's Monica? Really, really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  她就在前面  你应该过去打个招呼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, she's right down the street. Um, you should stop by and say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  我喜欢  她会很高兴的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I would love to. Yeah, she'd be so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   你不是要买\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, don't you have to pay for your...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《巨乳女郎》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Busty Ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  有个小孩托我帮他买\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's okay. Some kid asked me to pick it up for him, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.89,0:04:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你还在跟无聊医生交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Monica, still going outwith Dr. Boring, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他才不无聊   他只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's not boring. He's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是比较低调\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's just low-key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的榛果拿铁  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here you go, one hazelnut latte. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实榛果不是果实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, the hazelnut, actually not a nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是种籽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁能说出一种  假装是果实的常见种籽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can anyone else name a well-known seed that's been masquerading as a nut?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我想想看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, dear God. Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又被退稿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got another rejection letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说我的东西很有趣   只是不符合《阿奇漫画》风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They said my writing was funny, just not "Archie Comic funny."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我得回医院了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what honey? I gotta get back to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye. 'Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  答案是巴西果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, uh, by the way, the answer is the Brazil nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的问题比他的人更无趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was his question what's more boring than him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  退稿的事真可惜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, man. Sorry about that Archie thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我给你一些钱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You, uh, need me to give you some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我穷归穷   还是有骨气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I may have no money, but I still have my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许乔伊不必给你钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe Joey doesn't have to give you money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电视明星都有助理  对吧  可行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}TV stars have assistants, right? That's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我请助理转交   你会收吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I hire an assistant, would you take money from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.39,0:05:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦  乔伊  钱德可以当你的助理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Joey. Chandler could be your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以帮你回信给影迷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, he could answer your fan mail and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  好主意   就这么办吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great! That would be great! Let's do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有钱领   还有时间写作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could use the money. Give me time to write.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮  欢迎加入  感谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh right great! Welcome aboard. Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要去上厕所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Now hey, I need to use the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我上厕所不用人帮   你休息吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since I don't need any assistance in there, take a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿   菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎样   怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guess what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊找钱德当他的助理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey just hired Chandler to be his assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.26,0:06:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对   不对  我是说一到50点就卖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.No,no. I said sell when it hits 50!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,50是一个数字  在49后面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}5-0, It's a number! It comes after four-nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系   一次错误可以接受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's okay. It's okay. You're allowed one mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑的   你当然被开除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just kidding. You are of course fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  摩妮卡  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Mon? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.91,0:06:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看我遇见谁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon, look who I ran into.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好漂亮  你也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, you look terrific! Oh, so do you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是瘦了  这你都注意到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you lose weight? You are so sweet to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我瘦了三磅半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I lost 3 and a half pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得我的朋友钱德吧  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, and uh, you-you remember my friend Chandler? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那位是菲比  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's Phoebe over there!  Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  快坐下  我们多久没见面了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh my God, sit down. Sit down. How long's it been since we've seen each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1987年  圣诞节第二天   西巴麦克曼的派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}1987, the day after Christmas. Uh, at Sean McMahon’s party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:07:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弹了我的创作曲给你听  《星际求爱仪式》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I played you one of my songs. "Interplanetary Courtship Ritual."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在玩音乐吗  当然了  偶尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, now, do you, do you still do music? Well, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该来我家  我弹给你听  天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you should come over. Sometime I'll play you one of my other... Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我们的日子》的  乔伊崔比亚尼刚刚走进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey Tribbiani from Days of Our Lives just walked in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  他是我们的朋友  你们是雷莫瑞医生的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, he's a friend of ours. You are friends with Dr. Drake Ramoray?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要跟他交朋友有点难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well it's kinda hard to be friends with Drake...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他很忙  又是个虚构人物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because of his busy schedule and the fact that he's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也可以把键盘带来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, or I could bring my keyboard here sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他过来了  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's coming over. Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  拿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. Here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦   这是我朋友瑞秋  我们是高中同学\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. This is my friend Rachel. We went to high school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha, hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好喜欢你演的戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you on that show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. I watch you every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的前妻明明想杀你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, when you took out your kidney to save your ex-wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还捐肾救她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"eventhough she tried to kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遇见影迷总是很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's always nice to meet fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不会很神经吧  不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's not crazy, is she? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, uh, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hang on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你要替我工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're gonna like working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字   布伦蒂是个什么鸟名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's your name? What kind of name is Brindy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我   随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}L-Uh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  以后你就叫琼安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, from now on your name is Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姓你自己选\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can pick your own last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里  是  老板大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, there you are. Uh-oh, it's my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你今天的工作项目\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, here's a list of things for you to do today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is gonna be so great. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去接生双胞胎了  但只有一个是我的骨肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I gotta go to work. I'm delivering twins, but only one of them is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"把衣服送去干洗   去拿我的维他命"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Drop off my dry cleaning. Pick up my vitamins."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教我怎么写维他命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Teach me how to spell vitamins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"把我的新牛仔裤穿软"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Wear in my new jeans."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你的角色吧   什么角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You realize what you are, don't you? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是他的喽罗（小弟）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're his bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不   不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你不是压坏了我的巧克力酥吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait! You didn't sit on my Kit Kats did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  市场出了一点点变化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, there was a little, little dip in the market...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我损失了1千3百万\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I lost $13 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过   巧克力酥没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the Kit Kats are all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办  怎么办  通知公司  我会被砍死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I gonna do?! What am I gonna do? I can't call my office, they'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通知客户  他们会砍自己的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't call my clients, they'll kill themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  现在我的胸口痛   什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, now my chest hurts. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的胸口在痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My chest hurts. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是喘不过气来  菲比  你是心脏病发作吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh! And now, I can't breathe. Phoebe, are you having a heart attack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是  左臂会来回抽痛吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I were, would I have shooting pains up and down my left arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会  那就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Then, yes. That is what I'm having.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样   菲比  没那么严重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Pheebs, it's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般人如果可以休息两星期   会放鞭炮庆祝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know most people'd be excited if they didn't work for a couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般人不喜欢他们的工作  我喜欢我的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Most people don't like their jobs. I love my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才休息3小时就快疯掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been not working for three hours, and I'm already going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想念琼安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I miss Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心脏病发就表示你该放慢脚步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, having a heart attack is nature's way of telling you to slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为心脏病发  就表示你要死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I always thought having a heart attack was nature's way of telling you to die. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不会死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but you're not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你迟早会死  但不是今天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you are going to die, but you're not gonna die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去死算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去走走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该考虑去替  "讲话不经大脑" 杂志写稿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know maybe you should consider writing for Talking Out of Your Ass magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我练控手道练得更勤了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, um, I've been doing a lot more of my karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟卡萝还在干枯期   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Still going through that dry spell with Carol? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们多久没上床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How long has it been since you've had sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到上个周末   那还好嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, last weekend... That's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就已经2个月\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...will be two months...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有尝试了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...since I stopped trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你应该玩点刺激的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you need to spice things up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎讲  不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以绑住对方  可以在对方身上吃东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You could tie her up. You could eat stuff off each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.45,0:11:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淫言秽语  3P  辅助工具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dirty talk,  menage a trois, toys... Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,角色扮演  你当典狱长  她当囚犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Role-playing. You could be the warden; she could be the prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当海盗  她当村姑  好了  我懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You could be the pirate; she could be the wench. Okay, I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你们都当股票经纪人  裸体  在交易大厅地板上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Or too, you could be two Stockbrokers, and you're-you're-you're rolling naked on the trading floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,翻滚给大家看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and everybody's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没干过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  那里是布瑞帝酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, And over there is Brady's Pub...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我行完医喜欢去轻松一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...where I unwind after a long day of "surgeoning."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒喔  还有呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! This is so amazing. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个大型电视台设备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that is a large piece of television equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个老男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, that is an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老男人  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, old man! Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要不要回我家去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All righty. What do you say we head back to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想去  但是不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, wow. Um, you know, I would really love to, but I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么世界不能停止转动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why can't the world stop turning?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要一下下  只为了我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just for a moment. Just for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是戏里的台词吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't that a line from the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  不过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我或许说过同样的话   但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I may have said those things before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有这一刻   我才是真心的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I never truly meant them until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也是戏里的台词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a line from the show too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你电视看的太多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you watch too much TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  现榨的柳橙汁来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joe, here's the freshly-squeezed orange juice you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面有果肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, there's pulp in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.55,0:12:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是讲过了  我不喜欢果肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought we talked about this. I don't like pulp.
